- `SECURITY.md`: how to report a vulnerability privately.
- Idle states use the theme's secondary text colour (`--secondary-text-color`), like every ha-* card.
- README: the Marketplace section names the dashboard resource (`/local/community/…`).
- Biome 2.6.8, like the other ha-* repos (schema and pre-commit).

